 \nL703:   * Wire: Add `initialize` method for exchanging client/server info, external tools registration and slash commands advertisement\nL704:   * Wire: Support external tool calls via Wire protocol\nL705:   * Wire: Rename `ApprovalRequestResolved` to `ApprovalResponse` (backwards-compatible)\nL706: ## 0.79 (2026-01-19)\nL707:   * Skills: Add project-level skills support, discovered from `.agents/skills/` (or `.kimi/skills/`, `.claude/skills/`)\nL708:   * Skills: Unified skills discovery with layered loading (builtin → user → project); user-level skills now prefer `~/.config/agents/skills/`\nL709:   * Shell: Support fuzzy matching for slash command autocomplete\nL710:   * Shell: Enhanced approval request preview with shell command and diff content display, use `Ctrl-E` to expand full content\nL711:   * Wire: Add `ShellDisplayBlock` type for shell command display in approval requests\nL712:   * Shell: Reorder `/help` to show keyboard shortcuts before slash commands\nL713:   * Wire: Return proper JSON-RPC 2.0 error responses for invalid requests\nL714: ## 0.78 (2026-01-16)\nL715: \nL716:   * CLI: Add D2 flowchart format support for Prompt Flow (`.d2` extension)\nL717: ## 0.77 (2026-01-15)\nL718:   * Shell: Fix line breaking in `/help` and `/changelog` fullscreen pager display\nL719:   * Shell: Use `/model` to toggle thinking mode instead of Tab key\nL720:   * Config: Add `default_thinking` config option (need to run `/model` to select thinking mode after upgrade)\nL721:   * LLM: Add `always_thinking` capability for models that always use thinking mode\nL722:   * CLI: Rename `--command`/`-c` to `--prompt`/`-p`, keep `--command`/`-c` as alias, remove `--query`/`-q`\nL723:   * Wire: Fix approval requests not responding properly in Wire mode\nL724:   * CLI: Add `--prompt-flow` option to load a Mermaid flowchart file as a Prompt Flow\nL725:   * Core: Add `/begin` slash command if a Prompt Flow is loaded to start the flow\nL726:   * Core: Replace Ralph Loop with Prompt Flow-based implementation\nL727: ## 0.76 (2026-01-12)\nL728:   * Tool: Make `ReadFile` tool description reflect model capabilities for image/video support\nL729:   * Tool: Fix TypeScript files (`.ts`, `.tsx`, `.mts`, `.cts`) being misidentified as video files\nL730:   * Shell: Allow slash commands (`/help`, `/exit`, `/version`, `/changelog`, `/feedback`) in shell mode\nL731:   * Shell: Improve `/help` with fullscreen pager, showing slash commands, skills, and keyboard shortcuts\nL732:   * Shell: Improve `/changelog` and `/mcp` display with consistent bullet-style formatting\nL733:   * Shell: Show current model name in the bottom status bar\nL734:   * Shell: Add `Ctrl-/` shortcut to show help\nL735: ## 0.75 (2026-01-09)\nL736: \nL737:   * Tool: Improve `ReadFile` tool description\nL738:   * Skills: Add built-in `kimi-cli-help` skill to answer Kimi Code CLI usage and configuration questions\nL739: \nL740: ## 0.74 (2026-01-09)\nL741: \nL742:   * ACP: Allow ACP clients to select and switch models (with thinking variants)\nL743:   * ACP: Add `terminal-auth` authentication method for setup flow\nL744:   * CLI: Deprecate `--acp` option in favor of `kimi acp` subcommand\nL745:   * Tool: Support reading image and video files in `ReadFile` tool\nL746: ## 0.73 (2026-01-09)\nL747:   * Skills: Add built-in skill-creator skill shipped with the package\nL748:   * Tool: Expand `~` to the home directory in `ReadFile` paths\nL749:   * MCP: Ensure MCP tools finish loading before starting the agent loop\nL750:   * Wire: Fix Wire mode failing to accept valid `cancel` requests\nL751:   * Setup: Allow `/model` to switch between all available models for the selected provider\nL752:   * Lib: Re-export all Wire message types from `kimi_cli.wire.types`, as a replacement of `kimi_cli.wire.message`\nL753:   * Loop: Add `max_ralph_iterations` loop control config to limit extra Ralph iterations\nL754:   * Config: Rename `max_steps_per_run` to `max_steps_per_turn` in loop control config (backward-c